  "ID": "86514",
  "post_title": "La Boutique de la Rosquilleta t'ofereix diumenge les millors pastetes a la plaça d'Espanya, a Onda, i divendres els pastissos més variats",
  "post_date": "2021-02-07 09:36:13",
  "post_name": "la-boutique-de-la-rosquilleta-tofereix-diumenge-les-millors-pastetes-a-la-placa-despanya-a-onda-i-divendres-els-pastissos-salats-mes-variats",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Economía|Noticias|Sociedad",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2021/02/IMG_20210131_093306.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\" wfd-id=\"7\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\" wfd-id=\"8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38);\" wfd-id=\"12\">(28 fotos) Diumenge, de 8 a 13 hores, tenen les millors pastetes&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38);\" wfd-id=\"11\">a La boutique de la Rosquilleta,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38);\" wfd-id=\"10\">a la pla&ccedil;a d&#39;Espanya, 5, a Onda</span><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38);\" wfd-id=\"9\">. </span></span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2021/02/IMG_20210131_093233.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\" wfd-id=\"4\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\" wfd-id=\"5\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38);\" wfd-id=\"6\">I divendres podr&agrave;s trobar pastissos de totes classes, ximets, rosquilletes i m&eacute;s. </span></span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2021/02/IMG_20210205_084755.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\" wfd-id=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\" wfd-id=\"1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38);\" wfd-id=\"3\">Obert de dilluns a dissabte de 7.15 a 13.30 hores, tamb&eacute; tenen pa de maneres diferents, rotllos de Sant Antoni de l&#39;Alcora, pastissets dol&ccedil;os amb farcits variats, coca de poma</span><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38);\" wfd-id=\"2\">&nbsp;o conserves artesanes.</span></span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/boutiquerosquilleta/img_20210131_093226.jpg\" alt=\"img_20210131_093226\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/boutiquerosquilleta/img_20210131_093233.jpg\" alt=\"img_20210131_093233\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/boutiquerosquilleta/img_20210131_093245.jpg\" alt=\"img_20210131_093245\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/boutiquerosquilleta/img_20210131_093306.jpg\" alt=\"img_20210131_093306\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/boutiquerosquilleta/img_20210131_093319.jpg\" alt=\"img_20210131_093319\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/boutiquerosquilleta/img_20210131_093421.jpg\" alt=\"img_20210131_093421\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/boutiquerosquilleta/img_20210131_093844.jpg\" alt=\"img_20210131_093844\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/boutiquerosquilleta/img_20210131_093904.jpg\" alt=\"img_20210131_093904\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/boutiquerosquilleta/img_20210131_093917.jpg\" alt=\"img_20210131_093917\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/boutiquerosquilleta/img_20210131_094004.jpg\" alt=\"img_20210131_094004\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/boutiquerosquilleta/img_20210205_084755.jpg\" alt=\"img_20210205_084755\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/boutiquerosquilleta/img_20210205_084814.jpg\" alt=\"img_20210205_084814\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><im